{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04152","headline":"奉和兴庆池戏竞渡应制 · 徐彦伯","name":"奉和兴庆池戏竞渡应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夹道传呼翊翠虬，天回日转御芳洲。\n青潭晓霭笼仙跸，红屿晴花隔彩旒。\n香溢金杯环广坐，声传妓舸匝中流。\n羣臣相庆嘉鱼乐，共哂横汾歌吹秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}